            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name=" IV - Iron Warriors" id="e87f-c8ff-111b-3226" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <comment>Discount on Chaotic Astartes units</comment>
              <costs>
                <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Iron within, Iron without" id="cc75-8e70-72f9-f0d4" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this trait makes an attack, the target does not receive the benefits of cover against that attack.
- Each time an attack of Strength 7 or less is made against a unit with this trait, reduce the Strength of that attack by 1, and that attack’s Wound roll cannot be re-rolled.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name=" VIII - Night Lords" id="fb68-626e-f339-d4a6" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <costs>
                <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Strength from Dread" id="26ce-6f2d-0e1d-7228" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model with this trait makes an attack with a melee weapon, if that attack targets a unit without VEHICLE Keyword that is not in it&apos;s starting strength when the attacking unit was selected to fight, or if that attack targets a unit that has a Leadership characteristic of 6 or less, add 1 to that attack’s Wound roll.
Each time a model with this trait makes a ranged attack, if that attack targets a unit without the VEHICLE Keyword within 18&quot; that is below Half-strength, add 1 to that attack’s Wound roll.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name=" XVI - Black Legion" id="0d4e-60ff-af57-376e" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <costs>
                <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Black Crusaders" id="90be-d865-d906-e910" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a Combat Attrition test is taken for a unit with this legion trait, it is automatically passed.
Each time a model with this legion trait makes an attack, add 1 to that attacks hit roll if:
- That attack is a ranged attack and the target was the closest eligible enemy unit to the attacking model when its unit was selected to shoot.
- That attack is a ranged attack and the target is within 18&quot; from the attacking model when its unit was selected to shoot.
- That attack is a melee attack and the attacking model’s unit made a charge move, was charged or made an Heroic intervention this turn.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name=" XVII - Word Bearers" id="f68d-62e7-81d3-1712" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <costs>
                <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Profane Zeal" id="8e9f-8b30-83e3-7cdb" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this trait makes a melee attack, if that model’s unit made a charge move, was charged or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, you can re-roll that attack’s hit roll.
- Each time a model with this trait would lose a wound as the result of a mortal wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Warband - Custom Warband" id="7cf3-3a45-a879-0177" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <comment>Custom</comment>
              <costs>
