                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Reduce by 1 the Strength characteristic for attacks of Strength 7 or less against units with this legion trait.
- Add 1 to Wound rolls made by units with this legion trait against DAEMON or DAEMONIC units.</characteristic>
