                    <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">3</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time a model (excluding TITANIC or models that can Fly) loses any wounds as a result of an attack made with this weapon but is not destroyed, it is impaled until the start of your next Shooting phase. While a model is impaled, its Move characteristic is halved and each time a charge roll is made for the bearer, if that model’s unit is a target of that charge, add 2 to that charge roll.</characteristic>
