                      <infoLinks>
                        <infoLink name="Auspex Array" id="25e6-f06c-6467-5930" hidden="false" targetId="2840-f5e7-fc6e-2879" type="profile">
                          <modifiers>
                            <modifier field="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" type="set" value="- Each time the bearer makes a ranged attack, the target does not receive the benefits of cover against that attack.- Once per turn, during the Reinforcements step of the oponent&apos;s Movement phase, if a enemy unit that was set up as Reinforcements this turn and that is within 18&quot; of the bearer, you can select one CHAOS INFANTRY unit from your army that is not within Engagement Range of any enemy units, and within 12&quot; of that enemy unit. Your unit can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase, but its models can only target the selected enemy unit.">
                              <comment>- Each time the bearer makes a ranged attack, the target does not receive the benefits of cover against that attack.
- Once per turn, during the Reinforcements step of the oponent&apos;s Movement phase, if a enemy unit that was set up as Reinforcements this turn and that is within 18&quot; of the bearer, you can select one CHAOS INFANTRY unit from your army that is not within Engagement Range of any enemy units, and within 12&quot; of that enemy unit. Your unit can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase, but its models can only target the selected enemy unit.</comment>
                            </modifier>
                          </modifiers>
                        </infoLink>
                        <infoLink name="Omni-scrambler" id="fa8a-318e-9041-231b" hidden="false" targetId="a3fa-e298-db4d-642f" type="profile"/>
