          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, this model can attempt to make one Infernal Pact it knows that has not already been attempted by a friendly model this turn. Roll one D6: on a 3+, the pact is sealed and takes effect until the start of your next Command phase.</characteristic>
