        <profile name="Psy-power overload" id="17ca-905f-3a60-dc9a" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this unit is within 6&quot; of a friendly THOUSAND SONS PSYKER CHARACTER unit, during the Psychic phase, that unit can perfom a Psy-power overload [Action], with a Warp charge of 9. 
If that action is sucessfull, all the Force weapons this unit is bearing increment the AP characteristic by -1 and the Attacks characteristic by D3 (as additional attacks, Heavy 1--&gt; Heavy D3+1).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
