                <profile name="Thunderhawk Transporter" id="9989-3e3a-a2ae-4fd2" hidden="false" typeId="b3a8-0452-7436-44d1" typeName="Transport">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="15aa-1916-a38b-d223">- This model has a transport capacity of 15 &lt;LEGION&gt; INFANTRY models.
- Each JUMP PACK or TERMINATOR model takes the space of two INFANTRY models and each POSSESSED model takes the space of three INFANTRY models.
- It can transport BIKER models, each one takes the space of 3 INFANTRY models.
- It can transport DREADNOUGHT models of 10 Wounds or less, each one takes the space of 15 INFANTRY models.
- In addition,  it can transport up to two VEHICLE models, which, including units embarked within it, of the type RHINO, RAZORBACK, WHIRLWIND, VINDICATOR or PREDATOR.
- Instead of two vehicles, it can transport one VEHICLE model, which, including units embarked within it, of the type SICARAN, LAND RAIDER, LEVIATHAN DREADNOUGHT, DEREDEO DREADNOUGHT or SPARTAN.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
