                        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Plague Weapon. Each time an attack is made with this weapon against an non INORGANIC INFANTRY, CAVALRY, SWARM or BEAST unit, if the attack successfully wounds the target, it inflicts D3 mortal wounds in addition to any normal damage.</characteristic>
