                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly &lt;PLAGUE COMPANY&gt; CORE or &lt;PLAGUE COMPANY&gt; FOETID VIRION unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time that unit is selected to make a Normal Move or Advance, until the end of the phase, add 1&quot; to the Move characteristic of models in that unit.</characteristic>
