                <profile name="Malicious Calculation" id="e30c-fdb3-470a-3213" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, this model can tally for one friendly &lt;PLAGUE COMPANY&gt; CORE unit within 6&quot; of it. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, add 1 to that attack’s hit roll. Each unit can only be tallied for once per turn.</characteristic>
