                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time this WARLORD is within engagement range of any enemy CHARACTER units, then until that fight is resolved, add 1 to this WARLORD&apos;s Attacks characteristic.
