                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While an enemy unit (excluding INORGANIC and VEHICLE units) is within Contagion Range of this unit:
- That enemy unit cannot fire Overwatch or Set to Defend.
- Each time a model in that enemy unit makes an attack, the hit roll and the wound roll cannot be re-rolled.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
