                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- At the start of your Command phase, select one enemy unit without INORGANIC, VEHICLE, CHARACTER or TITANIC Keywords within 12&quot; of this WARLORD.
