            <profile name="A name revealed" id="50af-c2ce-ccda-f443" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- When this model is about to lose a wound, roll one D6, on a 5+ the wound is not lost. 
- At the beginning of your Command phase, it regains 1D3 Wounds.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Priest" id="fcff-1a8b-746b-2a7e" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This unit’s PRIEST model knows Dark Zealotry and 3 other prayers from the Prayers to the Dark Gods. 
In your Command phase, this unit’s PRIEST model can attempt to chant up to two prayers it knows that has not already been attempted by a friendly model this turn. Roll one D6: on a 2+, the prayer is heard and takes effect until the start of your next Command phase.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
