                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Malediction: Death Hex has a warp charge value of 8. If manifested, select one enemy unit within 12&quot; of this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, models in that unit cannot use any invulnerable saves.</characteristic>
