                    <characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd64-cbc4-94de-24cc">18&quot;</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Witchfire: Gift of Chaos has a warp charge value of 7. If manifested, the closest enemy unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER suffers D3 mortal wounds, and you must roll one D6 for every other enemy unit within 6&quot; of that unit: on a 4+, the unit being rolled for suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
