                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Weaver of Fates has a warp charge value of 7. If manifested, select one friendly THOUSAND SONS unit within 18&quot; of this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, models in that unit can re-roll Invulnerable saving throws.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
