                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Witchfire: Baleful Devolution has a warp charge value of 8. If manifested, select one enemy unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER that contains 6 or more models. Roll a number of D6 equal to the result of the Psychic test: for each roll of 6, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
