                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Malediction: Perplex has a warp charge value of 7. If manifested, select one enemy unit within 24&quot; of this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, each time that unit is selected to shoot, units more than 24&quot; away cannot be selected as the target of ranged attacks.</characteristic>
