                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Miasma of Pestilence has a warp charge value of 6. If manifested, select one friendly DEATH GUARD unit within 18&quot; of this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, each time a ranged attack is made against this unit, a hit roll of 1-3 for that attack fails. Substract 1 from that attack&apos;s hit roll.</characteristic>
