                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Malediction: Gift of Contagion has a warp charge value of 5. If manifested, select one enemy unit within 18&quot; of this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, subtract 1 from the Strength characteristic of models in that unit. If the result of the Psychic test was 8+, subtract 1 from the Strength and Attacks characteristics of models in that unit instead.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
