                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The first time the bearer is destroyed, keep it to one side; at the end of the current phase, set the bearer back up again, as close as possible to its previous position and more than 1&quot; away from any enemy models, with D3 wounds remaining.</characteristic>
