                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, in any phase, if the bearer is on the battlefield it can use Cha’qi’thl’s Theorem. If it does, select one Thousand Sons Stratagem. Until the end of the phase or until after you have used that Stratagem (whichever comes sooner), reduce the Command point cost of that Stratagem to 0.</characteristic>
