                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Select one melee weapon (excluding Relics) the bearer is equipped with.
That weapon is now a Relic for all rules purposes and has the Daemon Weapon ability.
Each time an attack is made with this weapon against a unit without INORGANIC, VEHICLE or TITANIC Keyword, if a hit is scored, that attack automatically wounds the target and the models cannot use any rules to ignore the wounds they lose.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Gorget of eternal hate" id="e430-88f7-0801-a30f" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
