                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Add 1 to armour saving throws made for the bearer.
- The bearer has a 4+ invulnerable save.
- The first time the bearer is destroyed, before removing it from play, roll one D6 for each enemy unit within 3&quot; of the bearer: on a 2-5, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 6, that enemy unit suffers 3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
