                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Model with two or more melee weapons only (excluding Relics). 
Select two melee weapons (excluding Relics) the bearer is equipped with.
Those weapons are now both Relics for all rules purposes and both have the Daemon Weapon ability. This model still only counts as being equipped with one Relic, however.
Each time the bearer is selected to fight, it can make an additional D3 attacks with each of these daemon weapons (roll separately for each).</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
