                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6fa97fa8-ea74-4a27-a0fb-bc4e5f367464">9&quot;</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Type" typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2">Grenade 1</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="S" typeId="59b1-319e-ec13-d466">-</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="AP" typeId="75aa-a838-b675-6484">-</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">-</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">The bearer can only shoot with this weapon once per battle, and hit rolls made with this weapon can never generate additional hits.
When an attack is made with this weapon, if a hit is scored against units without INORGANIC, VEHICLE or TITANIC Keywords:
The target unit suffers D3 mortal wounds for each model it has, and the attack sequence ends. If the target unit is have one or more models have 4 or more Wounds, add 3 mortal wounds for each model with those characteristics, and the attack sequence ends.
Until the end of the battle, subtract 1 from the Toughness characteristic of models in the target unit.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
