                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, at the start of your opponents Movement phase, the bearer can use this Relic. If it does, select one enemy unit within 6&quot;. Until the end of the phase, each time that unit is selected to Fall Back, roll one D6: on a 2+, that unit cannot Fall Back and must Remain Stationary instead.</characteristic>
