              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a552-7e17-559f-860e">If this prayer is heard, then while a friendly &lt;LEGION&gt; CORE, CULTISTS or &lt;LEGION&gt; CHARACTER unit is within 6&quot; of this PRIEST, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, you can re-roll the hit roll.</characteristic>
